 "intro_zh": "梅尔夫是中亚地区丝绸之路沿线最古老、保存最完好的绿洲城市。这片宽阔的绿洲横跨了4000年的人类历史，至今仍保留着许多纪念性的建筑，尤其是过去2000年来的建筑。",
 "intro_zh_source": "unesco_official",
 "intro_en": "Merv is the oldest and best-preserved of the oasis-cities along the Silk Route in Central Asia. The remains in this vast oasis span 4,000 years of human history. A number of monuments are still visible, particularly from the last two millennia.",
